{"availability":"available","full":"manideeppeyyala/amma-dishti","name":"amma-dishti","description":"అమ్మ దిష్టి · Upload Amma's photo and follow a guided dishti (evil-eye removal) with her face and voice. Telugu + English, no backend.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T07:09:00Z","updated":"2026-10-10T07:10:29Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://amma-dishti.vercel.app","topics":["pwa","telugu","vanilla-js","web-audio"],"demo":"https://amma-dishti.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:23.786Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:23.786Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:23.786Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:23.786Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["అమ్మ దగ్గర లేకపోయినా, అమ్మ దిష్టి నీతోనే. Amma may be far away, but her care is always with you.","A small, warm web app for Telugu people living away from home. You upload your mother's photo, pick how you want the dishti (evil-eye removal) done, and the app walks you through it step by step. On screen, Amma, with the uploaded photo as her face, moves the item around you with her own hand, while a warm background voice plays and the counts ring out: ఒకటి, రెండు, మూడు.","Everything runs in the browser. The photo and Amma's recordings never leave the phone. There is no server, no login and no tracking. No AI or robot voices are used anywhere. Only real human recordings play."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manideeppeyyala/amma-dishti/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a5cec96d6c9a1d83742597dee1a394ec4296d4ccc6d815cdcaf5f7e8a589c11d","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:23.928Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:23.928Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"అమ్మ దగ్గర లేకపోయినా, అమ్మ దిష్టి నీతోనే. Amma may be far away, but her care is always with you.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manideeppeyyala/amma-dishti/blob/main/README.